<title>USA: TABLE - FFBS Bancorp year end net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - FFBS Bancorp year end net rises.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Miss. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.97		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net			  1,478		    1,295</p>
<p> Total assets	   130,800		  125,300</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said results include a one-time, pre-tax charge of $599,000 (after-tax $376,000, or $0.25 per share) due to an assessment by the FDIC to fully capitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Full name is FFBS Bancorp Inc.</p>
</text>
